    "general": "General",
    "account": "Account",
    "faq_1": "Can I track my order's delivery status?",
    "faq_1_answer": "Yes, you can track your order's delivery status in real-time through the 'My Orders' section. Once your order is shipped, you'll receive a tracking ID that you can use to monitor the delivery progress.",
    "faq_2": "Is there a return policy?",
    "faq_2_answer": "Yes, we offer a 30-day return policy for most items. If you're not satisfied with your purchase, you can initiate a return through the app and we'll process your refund within 5-7 business days.",
    "faq_3": "Can I save my favorite items for later?",
    "faq_3_answer": "Absolutely! You can save items to your wishlist by tapping the heart icon on any product. Access your saved items anytime from the Wishlist tab.",
    "faq_4": "Can I share products with my friends?",
    "faq_4_answer": "Yes, you can share any product with your friends through various channels including messaging apps, email, and social media using the share button on the product page.",
    "faq_5": "How do I contact customer support?",
    "faq_5_answer": "You can reach our customer support team through multiple channels: in-app chat, email, phone, or social media. Visit the Contact Us section in Help Center for all available options.",
    "faq_6": "What payment methods are accepted?",
    "faq_6_answer": "We accept various payment methods including credit/debit cards (Visa, Mastercard), PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and our in-app e-wallet.",
    "faq_7": "How to add review?",
    "faq_7_answer": "After receiving your order, go to 'My Orders' > 'Completed' tab and tap 'Leave Review' on the item you want to review. You can rate the product, write a detailed review, and even add photos.",
